      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# DiffusionGemma Director to native MiniMax-H3 (Ref2VA)\n\n1. Replace the creative brief and both reference images. Keep their order aligned with the manifest: <Picture 1> is the protagonist identity; <Picture 2> is the environment and 2D animation style. The references guide the full clip, not first/last keyframes.\n2. Set Duration seconds. The same value controls Director planning and native H3 frame math. The sample is 20 seconds: at 24 fps it resolves to 481 valid frames on H3's 17k+5 temporal grid.\n3. Queue the workflow. DiffusionGemma unloads before H3 sampling. The generated prompt appears in the prompt preview; ComfyUI does not copy a linked runtime value into the native node's static prompt widget. A fail-closed readiness gate now prevents H3 conditioning and sampling when validation rejects or blanks the prompt.\n\nThe Director analysis batch resizes <Picture 2> to <Picture 1> only for multimodal inspection. Both original images feed the native H3 reference sockets separately and in the same order. This graph uses the Ref2VA transformer and 25 sampling steps."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000",
      "title": "How this sample works"
    },
