      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Create a 20-second 2D hand-drawn animated monster-duel short in a late-1800s spaghetti-western town square. Use <Picture 1> only for the protagonist's identity, appearance, wardrobe, and accessories. Use <Picture 2> only for the town-square environment, palette, lighting, and visual style; do not transfer any pictured subject identity. Stage a coherent three-beat confrontation with stable character designs, clear action and reaction, synchronized impacts, deliberate camera movement, and a resolved final frame. No subtitles, logos, or watermarks."
      ],
      "title": "1. Creative brief - state 2D animation explicitly"
    },
